  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPPF 2021-2025 Midterm Review</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the review is to assess the performance and organizational capacity of International Planned Parenthood Federation and its continued relevance and progress in pursuing the priority areas and results defined in the Organisation Strategy for Denmark&apos;s cooperation with IPPF. Elements include I) organizational capacity following internal restructuring and implementation of new IPPF Strategy; II) Synergy with other Danish engagements and modalities; III) Capacity within humanitarian action; IV) Recommendations as for potential new organization strategy and funding period.</narrative>
  </description>
